{"id":"1fe15836cb738242","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Cauchy Filter","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter — ZFC Analysis2 Cauchy Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter — ZFC Analysis2 Cauchy Filter","depends_on":["[[./58-df-filter-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter — ZFC Analysis2 Cauchy Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"./58-df-filter-set.md\">58-df-filter-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,d\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,d\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（集合上的滤子，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"./58-df-filter-set.md\">58-df-filter-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CauchyFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CauchyFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}filter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CauchyFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\epsilon)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}filter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CauchyFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(d(x,y)&lt;\\epsilon)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cauchy 性依赖具体度量；这里使用集合上滤子，而非偏序上的 forcing 滤子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-filter-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$（see [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2$（集合上的滤子，see [[./58-df-filter-set.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CauchyFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}cauchy\\text{-}filter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2CauchyFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,X,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\n\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(d(x,y)<\\epsilon)","display":true}],"bytes":1091,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1444","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter.md|58-df-zfc-analysis2-cauchy-filter]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["5a7d94a7a7f8209a","ce876585d129ce97"]}